---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro"
import { SITE, SOCIALS } from "@consts"
---
<PageLayout title="Software engineer" description={SITE.DESCRIPTION}>
  <div class="cv-home personal-home">
    <section class="cv-hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <p class="cv-eyebrow">Software engineer · Costa Rica</p>
      <h1 id="intro-title">Axel Fernández<br />Jiménez<span>.</span></h1>
      <p class="cv-intro">I build software, mostly with React and TypeScript. These days I lead frontend development: making technical decisions, working with designers, and helping the team put those decisions into practice.</p>
      <p class="personal-note">I've also worked on backend services and databases with Node.js, Java, .NET, and PostgreSQL. I like understanding what happens on both sides of an API.</p>
      <div class="cv-actions"><a class="cv-text-link" href="/work">Experience</a><a class="cv-text-link" href="/resume">Read or print my CV</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <h2 id="work-title">A few things I've worked on</h2>
      <a class="personal-project" href="/projects/shared-ui/"><span class="personal-project-context">Tebra · Software engineering</span><h3>Shared components and a brand migration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>A component library in Storybook, the Kareo-to-Tebra visual migration, and Java service work.</p></a>
    </section>
    <section class="cv-section personal-background" aria-labelledby="background-title">
      <h2 id="background-title">Background</h2>
      <div><p>I studied Computing Engineering at Tecnológico de Costa Rica, graduating in 2020, and completed a master's in Project Management at Universitat de Barcelona in 2022.</p><p>I work in English and Spanish. Alongside development, I interview frontend candidates and help the team agree on engineering standards.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section id="contact" class="cv-section personal-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Say hello</h2>
      <p>Email is the easiest way to reach me. You can also find my public repositories on GitHub.</p>
      <div class="cv-actions">{SOCIALS.map(s => <a class="cv-text-link" href={s.HREF}>{s.TEXT}</a>)}</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
